  lines:
  - '>>Good job making through that area.'
  - 'You: ...it was easy.'
  - '>>Oh so you can talk.'
  - '>>Anyways. There''s a prick blocking the next console.'
  - '>>No need to be mad. They''re just people who don''t know what we do.'
  - '>>Just LEFT CLICK to take care of em.'
  - '>>Be very aware of these kind of people ok?'
